-- comments
1:1 plain -- `...` is an `ellipsis` only as the first token of a hole opened in a tag
2:1 plain -- (frontend.md §9.1). Later in such a hole, in a children hole, and in
3:1 plain -- ordinary code `...a` lexes as it always did, `dot_dot` then `.a`: in the
4:1 plain -- tag's hole expected_token for the `...` (7:12) and the `}` (7:14), and in
5:1 plain -- the code unexpected_token (11:7). `Card` is not imported (7:6).
